# =========================
# ML model artifacts
# =========================
# Training checkpoints and intermediate exports (.pdparams/.pdopt, raw
# training logs, alternate/experimental exports) are excluded by default —
# only the final inference export is tracked. Checkpoints routinely run
# 130-250MB+, well over GitHub's 100MB hard limit; use Git LFS, cloud
# storage, or a release asset instead if a checkpoint ever needs to be
# shared.
model/*
!model/paddle/
model/paddle/*
!model/paddle/inference/
model/paddle/inference/*
!model/paddle/inference/rec_finetuned/